{"id":"c93b842603a6567f","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-final-segment.md","title":"ZFC Final Segment","display":"df-zfc-final-segment — ZFC Final Segment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-final-segment","aliases":["58-df-zfc-final-segment","58-df-zfc-order6-final-segment"],"display":"df-zfc-final-segment — ZFC Final Segment","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-final-segment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-final-segment</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-final-segment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-final-segment — ZFC Final Segment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\leq_L,F,X,R\\in V,\\ \\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L,\\ F\\subseteq L,\\ R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(L,\\leq_L,F,X,R\\in V,\\ \\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L,\\ F\\subseteq L,\\ R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinalSegment}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6FinalSegment}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinalSegment}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6FinalSegment}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}final\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinalSegment}_S(F,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_L,L)\\land F\\subseteq L\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(x\\leq_L y\\to y\\in F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}final\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinalSegment}_S(F,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_L,L)\\land F\\subseteq L\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(x\\leq_L y\\to y\\in F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}final\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6FinalSegment}_S(X,R,F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(R,X)\\land F\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}final\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6FinalSegment}_S(X,R,F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(R,X)\\land F\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-order6-final-segment</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>The order axioms are included, so upward closure is not asserted relative to an arbitrary binary relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\leq_L,F,X,R\\in V,\\ \\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L,\\ F\\subseteq L,\\ R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinalSegment}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6FinalSegment}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}final\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinalSegment}_S(F,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_L,L)\\land F\\subseteq L\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(x\\leq_L y\\to y\\in F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}final\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6FinalSegment}_S(X,R,F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(R,X)\\land F\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in F)","display":true}],"bytes":1342,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1932","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-final-segment.md|58-df-zfc-final-segment]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3